OL,3,GNEWSAMan who tampered with meter before
OL,4,Afire sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who bypassed an electricity
OL,7,Fmeter, which was discovered after a
OL,8,Fhouse fire killed a teenager, has been
OL,9,Fgiven a suspended sentence.
OL,11,FCalvin Smith, 38, had advertised on
OL,12,Fsocial media that he could help people
OL,13,F"beat the cost of living crisis" and
OL,14,Fget "free electricity" by tampering
OL,15,Fwith their meters.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
