OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan who tampered with meter before
OL,4,Afire sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe process was initially thought to
OL,7,Fhave caused a house fire which killed
OL,8,FLeah Cassion, 18, in North Shields in
OL,9,FJanuary 2023. The charges were dropped
OL,10,Fafter expert reports could not
OL,11,F"realistically establish" whether the
OL,12,Fmeter was responsible.
OL,14,FHowever, Smith still admitted
OL,15,Fabstracting electricity and was given a
OL,16,F16-week jail sentence suspended for two
OL,17,Fyears and 200 hours of unpaid work.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
